<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-Hant" data-lvt-canonical="1"><head>
<!--
Canvas: RWD 單頁（桌機以 1440px 設計，手機 390px 可用），全長滾動
Design given: 「成熟復古相簿 × 手帳博物館」——紙張顆粒、斂飾拼貼（旋轉≤±1.5deg）、柔和多層復古陰影、郵戳/燙金小標/細虛線細節；時光走廊與十景全面接入統一風格插畫；留言牆升級為可上傳照片的回憶相簿（拍立得相片卡＋♡共鳴＋lightbox＋排序）
Asset map: [hero] images_web/ViA8Pwl1IA9VWz2H.jpg -> Hero 滿版背景 cover（沿用）；[時光走廊 5 張 2048×1536] DGvCTiSKiN2UisWG/WmCYgFAVUPExRLyu/8Jb8JtP9SDKK5j9S/p15ZYpP8u74cCzc7/sk1gVDLMWCEFZehU -> 各節點左側 4:3 白邊相框 slot，cover，淡入＋hover scale1.03；[十景 10 張 2048×1536] wHjLMX9j11EsU9oW/mRx90WLTHRHOtlm5/FaCoffJTd02Uw8zi/iMMN5nrLUON4T95X/Dln5Ux7foyG4p26X/DPt2h40Y1cGC76SR/jfrrzE8jiYAzqldF/HNBHyjx7pFIy8nVL/2bZimchZet1V7qgR/VoR0FV0oBl2JcTio -> 拍立得卡圖片區 4:3 cover，中性色占位防閃爍，點擊開 lightbox（投他！按鈕事件分離）；[用戶上傳] canvas 壓縮（最長邊1000px、JPEG 0.75）轉 dataURL 存 localStorage，壓縮後>1.2MB toast 擋下
Palette: #F6EFE3 -> --bg、#FFFDF7 -> --paper、#C9563A -> --accent、#E8A87C -> --accent-soft、#2F4A3C -> --ink-green、#23304A -> --fg、#F4D35E -> --note-yellow、#F2B5A0 -> --note-pink、#9BC4A8 -> --note-mint、#6E6256 -> --muted（全部 given）；素色紙卡低飽和色 --card-yellow/pink/mint、燙金 --gold/--gold-lite（chosen，brief 要求降飽和與燙金小標但未給色值）
Typography: 區塊標題 Noto Serif TC 900＋手繪底線（given）；內文 Noto Sans TC；Caveat 僅限小標註（hero kicker/簽名/計數/提示）（given）；年份/票數/排名改 Serif（brief：Caveat 不再用於大區塊）
Content map: 原有 pinned 文案全數保留（校名、1965/1997/2006/2010、十景名稱與描述、四場講座 2026/11/11・11/18・11/25・12/2 19:30–21:00、免責註記、6 則預設留言含 3 則逐字）；留言牆標題改 brief 指定「回憶相簿：把你的南應，貼回這面牆」；十景卡 emoji 主視覺移除
Assumptions: 時光走廊由橫向滑動改縱向圖文手風琴（大圖放不進 200px 橫卡，「← 左右滑動 →」提示隨之移除）；種子留言給 14–42 固定基礎共鳴數、用戶新留言從 0 起算（brief：新留言初始 0）；lightbox 同時服務十景與回憶照片；舊版純文字留言以無 photo/id 欄位相容讀取，首次載入補發 id 遷移
QA risks: localStorage 容量（含照片）-> lsSetSafe try/catch＋專用 toast 不崩頁；lightbox 390px 可用性；舊資料相容；投票/報名/入會/數字遞增回歸
-->
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>南應大校友互動記憶牆 ｜ TUT Alumni Memory Wall</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@600;700;900&amp;family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&amp;family=Caveat:wght@500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F6EFE3;
  --paper:#FFFDF7;
  --accent:#C9563A;
  --accent-soft:#E8A87C;
  --ink-green:#2F4A3C;
  --fg:#23304A;
  --note-yellow:#F4D35E;
  --note-pink:#F2B5A0;
  --note-mint:#9BC4A8;
  --muted:#6E6256;
  --serif:'Noto Serif TC', serif;
  --sans:'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
  --hand:'Caveat', cursive;
  --gold:#B8860B;
  --gold-lite:#E3C468;
  --card-yellow:#F2E3B6;
  --card-yellow-2:#E9D79E;
  --card-pink:#EFD2C4;
  --card-pink-2:#E5C0AD;
  --card-mint:#CADCD0;
  --card-mint-2:#B7CDBD;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(35,48,74,.07), 0 6px 14px rgba(35,48,74,.10), 0 18px 36px rgba(35,48,74,.07);
  --shadow-lift:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.08), 0 12px 24px rgba(35,48,74,.14), 0 26px 48px rgba(35,48,74,.10);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{
  font-family:var(--sans);
  color:var(--fg);
  background-color:var(--bg);
  /* 紙張顆粒噪點感 */
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(rgba(110,98,86,.05) 1px, transparent 1.4px),
    radial-gradient(rgba(110,98,86,.035) 1px, transparent 1.4px);
  background-size:22px 22px, 13px 13px;
  background-position:0 0, 7px 9px;
  line-height:1.7;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;}
::selection{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--fg);}

/* ============ 通用 ============ */
.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
.section{padding:96px 0;}
.sec-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px;position:relative;}
.sec-head .eyebrow{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--gold) 10%,var(--gold-lite) 45%,var(--gold) 80%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:var(--gold);
  display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;}
.sec-head h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:36px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--fg);position:relative;display:inline-block;padding-bottom:14px;}
/* 手繪底線裝飾 */
.sec-head h2::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:1%;right:1%;bottom:2px;height:7px;background:var(--accent-soft);opacity:.75;
  border-radius:52% 48% 46% 54%/75% 68% 32% 25%;transform:rotate(-.35deg);}
.sec-head .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:14px;}
/* 郵戳裝飾 */
.postmark{position:absolute;top:-58px;right:1%;width:72px;height:72px;border:2px dashed rgba(201,86,58,.42);border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:9px;
  letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(201,86,58,.55);transform:rotate(-12deg);pointer-events:none;line-height:1.5;}
.postmark i{font-style:normal;display:block;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,86,58,.4);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,86,58,.4);padding:2px 0;margin:2px 0;}
/* 紅色手繪圈記 */
.circle-mark{position:relative;display:inline-block;}
.circle-mark::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:-14px;right:-14px;top:-10px;bottom:-10px;
  border:3px solid var(--accent);border-radius:52% 48% 55% 45% / 60% 55% 45% 40%;
  opacity:.75;pointer-events:none;transform:rotate(-1.5deg);
}
/* 紙膠帶 */
.tape{position:absolute;width:110px;height:30px;background:rgba(232,168,124,.55);
  box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.12);pointer-events:none;z-index:3;}
.tape::before,.tape::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:6px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 2px,rgba(255,253,247,.5) 2px 4px);}
.tape::before{left:0;} .tape::after{right:0;}
.tape-green{background:rgba(155,196,168,.55);}
.tape-yellow{background:rgba(244,211,94,.6);}

/* 按鈕兩款 */
.btn{display:inline-block;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;
  padding:14px 30px;border:2px solid var(--ink-green);transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s;
  text-align:center;}
.btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:3px;}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFDF7;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.14), 0 8px 18px rgba(201,86,58,.22);}
.btn-primary:hover,.btn-primary:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(35,48,74,.16), 0 14px 28px rgba(201,86,58,.28);}
.btn-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(35,48,74,.16);}
.btn-outline{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink-green);box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.1), 0 8px 16px rgba(35,48,74,.1);}
.btn-outline:hover,.btn-outline:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(35,48,74,.12), 0 14px 26px rgba(35,48,74,.14);background:#fff;}
.btn[disabled]{opacity:.65;cursor:default;transform:none !important;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.1) !important;}

/* 捲動淡入 */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

/* ============ 導覽列 ============ */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(246,239,227,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border-bottom:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.4);}
.nav-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;}
.nav-logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:19px;color:var(--ink-green);white-space:nowrap;}
.nav-logo small{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:16px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-left:6px;}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;}
.nav-links a{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--fg);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:4px;transition:background .15s,color .15s;white-space:nowrap;}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a:focus-visible{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFDF7;outline:none;}
.nav-burger{display:none;background:none;border:2px solid var(--ink-green);border-radius:4px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-green);}

/* ============ Hero ============ */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  background:
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,26,38,.62) 0%, rgba(35,48,74,.5) 45%, rgba(20,26,38,.78) 100%),
    url('images_web/ViA8Pwl1IA9VWz2H.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
  background-color:#23304A;
  color:#FFFDF7;padding:120px 0 0;}
.hero-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.hero-kicker{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:26px;color:var(--note-yellow);letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:18px;}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:56px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.02em;
  text-shadow:0 3px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45);margin-bottom:20px;}
.hero-sub{font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,253,247,.92);max-width:640px;margin-bottom:36px;text-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:64px;}
.hero .btn-outline{background:transparent;color:#FFFDF7;border-color:#FFFDF7;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.2), 0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18);}
.hero .btn-outline:hover,.hero .btn-outline:focus-visible{background:rgba(255,253,247,.14);box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.24), 0 16px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.22);}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:0;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.45);padding-top:26px;margin-bottom:40px;}
.stat{flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:0 24px;border-left:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.35);}
.stat:first-child{border-left:none;padding-left:0;}
.stat .num{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:44px;color:var(--note-yellow);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:.02em;}
.stat .num::after{content:"";font-size:.5em;}
.stat .lbl{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,253,247,.85);margin-top:4px;}
.hero-scroll{position:absolute;right:32px;bottom:28px;z-index:3;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:22px;color:#FFFDF7;
  animation:bob 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;text-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
@keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(10px);}}

/* ============ Section 2 時光走廊 ============ */
.tl-rail{position:relative;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}
.tl-rail::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:27px;top:22px;bottom:14px;width:2px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent) 0 10px, transparent 10px 18px);opacity:.55;}
.tl-node{position:relative;padding-left:76px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.tl-node:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
.tl-dot{position:absolute;left:15px;top:30px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper);
  border:4px solid var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--bg), 0 2px 6px rgba(35,48,74,.18);z-index:2;}
.tl-node.open .tl-dot{background:var(--accent);}
.tl-card{background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);border-radius:8px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, border-color .28s;}
.tl-card:hover,.tl-card:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);outline:none;border-color:rgba(201,86,58,.45);}
.tl-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,38%) 1fr;gap:0;}
.tl-media{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#E9DFC8;margin:14px;border-radius:4px;padding:7px;
  box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(35,48,74,.12), 0 6px 14px rgba(35,48,74,.10);}
.tl-media img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;display:block;
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .5s ease;filter:sepia(.08) saturate(.97);}
.tl-media img.loaded{opacity:1;}
.tl-media img{cursor:zoom-in;}
.tl-zoom{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;z-index:2;background:rgba(20,24,32,.6);color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;pointer-events:none;}
.ncard-pending{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;color:#8a5a00;background:#fff3cd;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.join-real-note{margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;opacity:.85;}
.tl-card:hover .tl-media img{transform:scale(1.03);}
.tl-body{padding:26px 28px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}
.tl-body .yr{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:40px;color:var(--accent);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.01em;}
.tl-body h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--ink-green);}
.tl-body .peek{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
.tl-body .peek::after{content:"▾";font-size:12px;transition:transform .3s;}
.tl-node.open .tl-body .peek::after{transform:rotate(180deg);}
.tl-story{font-size:15px;color:var(--fg);max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;
  transition:max-height .45s ease, opacity .45s ease, margin-top .3s, padding-top .3s, border-top-width .1s;
  border-top:0 dashed rgba(110,98,86,.4);margin-top:0;padding-top:0;}
.tl-node.open .tl-story{max-height:260px;opacity:1;margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;border-top-width:1.5px;}

/* ============ Section 3 十景投票 ============ */
.vote-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:34px 28px;}
.polaroid{background:var(--paper);padding:13px 13px 16px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  border:1px solid rgba(110,98,86,.22);position:relative;transition:transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;}
.polaroid:nth-child(3n+1){transform:rotate(-1.4deg);}
.polaroid:nth-child(3n+2){transform:rotate(1.1deg);}
.polaroid:nth-child(3n){transform:rotate(-.5deg);}
.polaroid:hover{transform:rotate(0deg) translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);z-index:2;}
.polaroid .tape{top:-13px;left:50%;margin-left:-52px;transform:rotate(-1.5deg);}
.scene{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:2px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#E5DCC7;cursor:zoom-in;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(110,98,86,.18);}
.scene img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .4s ease;}
.scene img.loaded{opacity:1;}
.polaroid:hover .scene img{transform:scale(1.03);}
.polaroid .cap{text-align:center;padding:13px 6px 2px;}
.polaroid .cap .idx{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#8A6A16;letter-spacing:.18em;}
.polaroid .cap h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:var(--fg);margin:4px 0 4px;}
.polaroid .cap p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);min-height:2.6em;}
.vote-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:10px 6px 0;border-top:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.35);margin-top:10px;}
.vote-count{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-green);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;}
.vote-count b{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);}
.btn-vote{background:var(--accent);color:#FFFDF7;border:1.5px solid var(--accent);border-radius:4px;
  font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:9px 18px;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(35,48,74,.14), 0 6px 14px rgba(201,86,58,.22);
  transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .18s, background .18s;white-space:nowrap;}
.btn-vote:hover:not([disabled]),.btn-vote:focus-visible:not([disabled]){transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(35,48,74,.16), 0 10px 20px rgba(201,86,58,.28);}
.btn-vote[disabled]{background:var(--ink-green);border-color:var(--ink-green);color:#DDE8DF;box-shadow:none;}
.polaroid.pop{animation:pop .45s ease;}
@keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(1);}40%{transform:scale(1.05) rotate(0deg);}100%{transform:scale(1);}}
/* 排行列 */
.rank-bar{margin-top:56px;background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);border-radius:10px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:26px 28px;position:relative;}
.rank-bar h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink-green);text-align:center;margin-bottom:18px;}
.rank-list{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.rank-item{flex:1;min-width:200px;max-width:300px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;text-align:center;
  border:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.5);transition:transform .3s;}
.rank-item .place{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.04em;}
.rank-item.r1 .place{color:var(--gold);} .rank-item.r1{background:rgba(244,211,94,.16);border-color:rgba(184,134,11,.4);}
.rank-item .nm{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin:2px 0;}
.rank-item .vt{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);}

/* ============ Section 4 回憶相簿牆 ============ */
.wall-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:380px 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:start;}
.form-card{background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);border-radius:10px;padding:28px 26px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:88px;}
.form-card .tape{top:-13px;left:50%;margin-left:-52px;transform:rotate(1.2deg);}
.form-card h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink-green);margin-bottom:18px;text-align:center;}
.field{margin-bottom:16px;}
.field label{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:6px;}
.field input[type=text],.field select,.field textarea,.field input[type=email],.field input[type=tel]{
  width:100%;border:2px solid rgba(110,98,86,.45);border-radius:5px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:15px;
  font-family:inherit;background:#fff;color:var(--fg);transition:border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(201,86,58,.18);}
.field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:110px;}
.counter{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;margin-top:4px;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:17px;}
.color-pick{display:flex;gap:12px;}
.color-pick input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
.color-pick label{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .15s, border-color .15s;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.6), 0 2px 5px rgba(35,48,74,.2);margin:0;}
.color-pick label:hover{transform:scale(1.1);}
.color-pick input:checked + label{border-color:var(--ink-green);transform:scale(1.12);}
.color-pick input:focus-visible + label{outline:3px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px;}
.cy{background:var(--card-yellow);} .cp{background:var(--card-pink);} .cm{background:var(--card-mint);}
.form-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;text-align:center;line-height:1.6;}
.btn-submit{width:100%;margin-top:6px;}
/* 照片上傳欄位 */
.field-file{margin-top:16px;}
.file-drop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px;border:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.5);
  border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s, background .15s;}
.file-drop:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(201,86,58,.05);}
.file-drop .fd-icon{font-size:24px;}
.file-drop .fd-txt{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;}
.file-preview{display:none;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;}
.file-preview.show{display:flex;}
.file-preview img{width:88px;height:66px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);
  box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(35,48,74,.15);}
.file-preview .fp-meta{flex:1;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);}
.file-preview .fp-remove{background:none;border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.5);border-radius:50%;width:30px;height:30px;
  font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0;transition:border-color .15s,color .15s;}
.file-preview .fp-remove:hover,.file-preview .fp-remove:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}
/* 排序切換 */
.wall-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:16px;}
.sort-toggle{display:flex;border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.45);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--paper);}
.sort-toggle button{padding:8px 16px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);background:none;border:none;
  border-left:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.3);transition:background .15s,color .15s;}
.sort-toggle button:first-child{border-left:none;}
.sort-toggle button.on{background:var(--ink-green);color:#FFFDF7;font-weight:700;}
.sort-toggle button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:-2px;}
/* 相簿牆：拍立得相片卡 + 素色紙卡 */
.notes-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;}
.ncard{background:var(--paper);border-radius:4px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid rgba(110,98,86,.2);
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 12px 10px;transition:transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;}
.ncard:nth-child(3n+1){transform:rotate(-1.3deg);}
.ncard:nth-child(3n+2){transform:rotate(1deg);}
.ncard:nth-child(3n){transform:rotate(-.5deg);}
.ncard:hover{transform:rotate(0) translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);z-index:2;}
.ncard-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:#E5DCC7;cursor:zoom-in;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(110,98,86,.18);position:relative;}
.ncard-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .4s ease;}
.ncard:hover .ncard-photo img{transform:scale(1.03);}
.ncard-txt{font-size:14.5px;color:#3a3128;flex:1;line-height:1.75;padding:12px 4px 0;font-family:var(--hand);font-size:19px;}
.ncard-sig{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:18px;color:rgba(35,48,74,.75);text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding:6px 4px 0;}
.ncard-foot{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.35);margin-top:8px;}
.btn-echo{background:none;border:1.5px solid rgba(201,86,58,.5);border-radius:99px;padding:5px 14px;font-size:13px;
  color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;transition:background .18s,color .18s,transform .18s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.btn-echo:hover{background:rgba(201,86,58,.1);}
.btn-echo:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;}
.btn-echo.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#FFFDF7;}
.btn-echo.on:hover{transform:scale(1.05);}
/* 無照片素色紙卡（美術紙卡，低飽和） */
.ncard.plain{padding:22px 20px 12px;border-radius:3px;}
.ncard.plain .ncard-txt{padding-top:0;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14.5px;}
.ncard.plain.note-yellow{background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--card-yellow),var(--card-yellow-2));}
.ncard.plain.note-pink{background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--card-pink),var(--card-pink-2));}
.ncard.plain.note-mint{background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--card-mint),var(--card-mint-2));}
.ncard.plain::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:2px;pointer-events:none;}
.ncard.plain::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:76px;height:22px;
  background:rgba(255,253,247,.5);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(35,48,74,.12);border-left:1px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.25);
  border-right:1px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.25);}
.ncard.new{animation:noteIn .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
@keyframes noteIn{0%{transform:scale(.4) rotate(-5deg);opacity:0;}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}

/* ============ Section 5 講座 ============ */
.talks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;}
.talk{background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);border-radius:10px;padding:24px 20px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s;}
.talk:nth-child(odd){transform:rotate(-.6deg);}
.talk:nth-child(even){transform:rotate(.6deg);}
.talk:hover{transform:rotate(0) translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);z-index:2;}
.talk .no{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:24px;color:#8A6A16;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.06em;}
.talk h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--fg);margin:10px 0 8px;}
.talk .desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;}
.talk .when{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-green);background:rgba(155,196,168,.18);
  border-radius:5px;padding:9px 11px;margin-bottom:12px;border:1.5px dashed rgba(47,74,60,.4);}
.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.tag{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);background:rgba(232,168,124,.16);
  border:1.5px solid var(--accent-soft);border-radius:99px;padding:4px 12px;}
.talk .btn{margin-top:auto;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;}
.talks-note{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:28px;}
/*  stamp 郵票齒輪裝飾 */
.stamp{position:absolute;top:-13px;right:14px;width:52px;height:60px;background:var(--accent);
  -webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle 4px at 4px 4px, transparent 98%, #000) -4px -4px / 12px 12px;
  mask:radial-gradient(circle 4px at 4px 4px, transparent 98%, #000) -4px -4px / 12px 12px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFDF7;font-family:var(--serif);
  font-weight:900;font-size:16px;transform:rotate(3deg);box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(35,48,74,.2);}
.stamp span{background:var(--accent);width:calc(100% - 10px);height:calc(100% - 10px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.7);}

.talk .want-count{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-green);margin:auto 0 12px;min-height:1.6em;}
.talk .want-count b{font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);}
.talk .btn{margin-top:0;}
.wish{max-width:640px;margin:40px auto 0;background:var(--paper);border:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.5);border-radius:10px;padding:26px 24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;}
.wish h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--fg);}
.wish-sub{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px;}
.wish textarea,.wish input[type=text]{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:11px 12px;margin-bottom:12px;border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#FFFDF7;color:var(--fg);}
.wish textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:84px;}
.wish .btn{width:100%;}
.wish-out{min-height:1.6em;margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-green);text-align:center;}
.res-card{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:left;font:inherit;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;}
.res-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--note-yellow);outline-offset:3px;}
.res-card[aria-expanded="true"]{background:rgba(255,253,247,.18);border-style:solid;}
.res-more{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--note-yellow);}
.res-panel{margin:-26px 0 52px;padding:28px 26px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,253,247,.5);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,253,247,.1);}
.res-panel[hidden]{display:none;}
.res-panel h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:var(--note-yellow);margin:0 0 4px;}
.res-panel .rp-sub{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,253,247,.8);margin:0 0 18px;}
.res-panel .soon{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;text-align:center;padding:18px 0;color:#FFFDF7;}
.biz-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px 22px;}
.biz-list li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.3);}
.biz-list .no{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;color:var(--note-yellow);min-width:2ch;text-align:right;}
.biz-list .nm{font-weight:900;font-size:17px;color:#FFFDF7;}
.biz-list .tt{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,253,247,.8);line-height:1.5;}
.join-btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:center;}
.btn-support{background:#FFFDF7;color:var(--accent);}
.btn-support.pop{animation:supportPop .35s ease;}
@keyframes supportPop{50%{transform:scale(1.07);}}
.support-count{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:18px;color:#FFFDF7;}
.support-count b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;color:var(--note-yellow);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
@media (max-width:760px){.biz-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.btn-join{width:100%;padding:16px 20px;}.res-panel{margin-top:-30px;}}
/* ============ Modal ============ */
.modal-mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,26,38,.55);z-index:200;display:none;
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(3px);}
.modal-mask.show{display:flex;animation:fadeIn .25s ease;}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
.modal{background:var(--paper);border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.5);border-radius:12px;max-width:520px;width:100%;
  max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:30px 28px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  animation:modalIn .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.4,.64,1);}
@keyframes modalIn{from{transform:scale(.85) translateY(24px);opacity:0;}to{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}
.modal .tape{top:-13px;left:50%;margin-left:-52px;transform:rotate(-1.5deg);}
.modal h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink-green);margin-bottom:4px;text-align:center;}
.modal .m-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.modal-close{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--ink-green);border-radius:50%;
  width:36px;height:36px;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink-green);line-height:1;transition:background .15s,color .15s;}
.modal-close:hover,.modal-close:focus-visible{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
.check-group{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:6px;}
.check-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:5px;padding:10px 12px;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid transparent;transition:border-color .15s;}
.check-item:hover{border-color:var(--accent-soft);}
.check-item input{margin-top:4px;accent-color:var(--accent);width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;}
.modal-success{text-align:center;padding:24px 0;}
.modal-success .big{font-size:56px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.modal-success h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink-green);margin-bottom:8px;}
.modal-success p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;}

/* ============ Section 6 加入校友會 ============ */
.join{background:var(--ink-green);color:#FFFDF7;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,253,247,.05) 1px, transparent 1.4px);background-size:20px 20px;}
.join .sec-head h2{color:#FFFDF7;}
.join .sec-head .sub{color:rgba(255,253,247,.75);}
.res-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;margin-bottom:52px;}
.res-card{background:rgba(255,253,247,.07);border:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.45);border-radius:10px;
  padding:30px 26px;text-align:center;transition:transform .22s, background .22s;}
.res-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);background:rgba(255,253,247,.12);}
.res-card .ic{font-size:46px;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;}
.res-card h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:var(--note-yellow);margin-bottom:8px;}
.res-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,253,247,.85);}
.join-cta-wrap{text-align:center;}
.btn-join{font-size:20px;padding:18px 52px;background:var(--accent);color:#FFFDF7;border:2px solid var(--note-yellow);
  box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25), 0 14px 32px rgba(201,86,58,.35);border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .18s;}
.btn-join:hover:not([disabled]),.btn-join:focus-visible:not([disabled]){transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.3), 0 20px 40px rgba(201,86,58,.4);}
.btn-join[disabled]{background:rgba(255,253,247,.16);border-color:rgba(255,253,247,.5);color:var(--note-yellow);box-shadow:none;cursor:default;}
.join-form{max-width:640px;margin:36px auto 0;background:rgba(255,253,247,.08);border:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.5);
  border-radius:10px;padding:28px;display:none;}
.join-form.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn .35s ease;}
.join-form .field label{color:#FFFDF7;}
.join-form .field input,.join-form .field select{background:rgba(255,253,247,.95);border-color:rgba(255,253,247,.6);color:var(--fg);}
.join-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px;}
.join-grid .full{grid-column:1 / -1;}
/* ============ 頁尾 ============ */
.footer{background:#232B3D;color:rgba(255,253,247,.7);text-align:center;padding:34px 24px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:2;}
.footer a{color:var(--note-yellow);font-weight:500;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(244,211,94,.5);}
.footer a:hover{color:#fff;}

/* ============ Toast ============ */
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:36px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(120px);z-index:300;
  background:var(--ink-green);color:#FFFDF7;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:99px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);border:1.5px solid var(--note-yellow);opacity:0;
  transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.34,1.5,.64,1), opacity .3s;max-width:calc(100vw - 40px);text-align:center;}
.toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);opacity:1;}

/* ============ Lightbox ============ */
.lightbox{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(12,15,22,.9);z-index:250;display:none;
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;}
.lightbox.show{display:flex;animation:fadeIn .25s ease;}
.lb-frame{position:relative;max-width:90vw;max-height:88vh;background:var(--paper);padding:14px 14px 18px;border-radius:4px;
  box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55);}
.lb-frame img{max-width:calc(90vw - 28px);max-height:calc(88vh - 90px);width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block;border-radius:2px;}
.lb-caption{text-align:center;padding:12px 10px 0;}
.lb-caption h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:900;font-size:18px;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:2px;}
.lb-caption p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);}
.lb-close{position:absolute;top:-16px;right:-16px;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper);
  border:1.5px solid rgba(110,98,86,.5);color:var(--fg);font-size:17px;line-height:1;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  transition:background .15s,color .15s;}
.lb-close:hover,.lb-close:focus-visible{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
.lb-nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,253,247,.92);border:none;font-size:20px;color:var(--fg);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  transition:background .15s,transform .15s;}
.lb-nav:hover,.lb-nav:focus-visible{background:var(--note-yellow);transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1.06);}
.lb-prev{left:-60px;} .lb-next{right:-60px;}
@media (max-width:820px){
  .lightbox{padding:16px;}
  .lb-frame{max-width:94vw;padding:10px 10px 12px;}
  .lb-frame img{max-width:calc(94vw - 20px);max-height:calc(84vh - 80px);}
  .lb-nav{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:17px;}
  .lb-prev{left:6px;} .lb-next{right:6px;background:rgba(255,253,247,.94);}
  .lb-close{top:-12px;right:-8px;width:36px;height:36px;}
}

/* ============ RWD ============ */
@media (max-width:1024px){
  .vote-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .talks{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .wall-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .form-card{position:static;}
  .notes-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .section{padding:64px 0;}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:27px;}
  .postmark{width:58px;height:58px;font-size:7.5px;top:-44px;right:0;}
  .hero h1{font-size:34px;}
  .hero-sub{font-size:16px;}
  .stat{min-width:100%;border-left:none;padding:10px 0;border-top:1.5px dashed rgba(255,253,247,.3);}
  .stat:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .stat .num{font-size:36px;}
  .hero-scroll{right:16px;font-size:19px;}
  .nav-links{position:fixed;top:64px;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(246,239,227,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0;padding:10px 16px 18px;border-bottom:1.5px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.4);
    display:none;box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(35,48,74,.15);}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex;}
  .nav-links a{padding:13px 12px;font-size:16px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(110,98,86,.25);}
  .nav-burger{display:block;}
  .vote-grid,.talks,.notes-grid,.res-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .join-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .rank-list{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;}
  .rank-item{max-width:none;}
  /* 時光走廊手機：圖上文下 */
  .tl-rail::before{left:17px;}
  .tl-node{padding-left:52px;}
  .tl-dot{left:6px;top:22px;width:22px;height:22px;}
  .tl-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .tl-media{margin:12px;}
  .tl-body{padding:6px 18px 20px;}
  .tl-body .yr{font-size:32px;}
  .wall-toolbar{justify-content:center;}
}
</style>
</head>
